    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Statement"/>
    <skos:definition>A single machine-readable proposition (subject - predicate - object) held true by an Assertion. Modelled as a singleton proposition set (CRMinf I4); the predicate is a URI/CURIE, the object either a heritage entity or a literal.</skos:definition>
